# Vibe ERP

Next.js 15 + TypeScript + Prisma (SQLite) AP/bills app for Campfire interview prep.

## Key paths
- `src/app/page.tsx` — dashboard (unpaid total)
- `src/app/bills/` — bill list table
- `src/app/import/` — CSV import UI
- `src/app/api/import/route.ts` — import API
- `lib/csv.ts` — CSV parsing (header-based: vendor, amount, due_date, invoice_number)
- `lib/dates.ts` — daysPastDue()
- `fixtures/bills.csv` — sample customer CSV
- `docs/bill_format_spec.pdf.txt` — customer spec (may not match real CSV layout)

## Stack conventions
- Use `@/` path alias for imports from repo root
- Server components fetch via Prisma directly; client components use `"use client"`
- Money stored as Prisma Decimal; avoid parseFloat for totals
- Dates: use parseDateOnly() for YYYY-MM-DD CSV values

## Commands
- `npm run dev` — start dev server (TZ=UTC)
- `npm run reset` — wipe DB, migrate, seed
